{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/telemetryevent\/configclamped(setting:requested:effective:contractreference:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Emitted at client construction, once per caller-supplied setting the SDK clamped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(§19.1, §19.2 rule 6).","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configClamped","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"setting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requested","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effective","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contractReference","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"setting","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The configuration property’s name, e.g. "},{"code":"decisionMemoTtl","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"requested","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value the caller asked for, rendered."}]}]},{"name":"effective","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value actually in force, rendered."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"contractReference","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The §-reference for the limit, e.g. "},{"code":"§17.1 rule 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Clamping rather than rejecting is the right call — rejecting would fail construction for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller whose configuration was merely optimistic, and honoring would let one client become","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the herd §16 exists to prevent. Doing it ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"silently"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is the part that is wrong: an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operator who set a 60-second memo TTL believes their staleness bound is 60 seconds. It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"five, and their revocation reasoning is off by a factor of twelve with nothing anywhere to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"say so.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Not emitted for a value already within its limit: an event that fires when nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"happened trains its reader to ignore it.","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Case","title":"TelemetryEvent.configClamped(setting:requested:effective:contractReference:)","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK14TelemetryEventO13configClampedyACSS_S3StcACmF","symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"configClamped"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"setting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","te